
TY  - JOUR
T1  - Spaceborne Far-Infrared Signal Simulations Over the Antarctic Plateau With Temperature-Dependent Ice Cloud Optical Properties
AU  - Ren, Tong
AU  - Yang, Ping
AU  - Huang, Xianglei
Y1  - 2026/09/16
PY  - 2026
DA  - 2026/09/16
DO  - https://doi.org/10.1029/2025JD045957
T2  - Journal of Geophysical Research: Atmospheres
